      "quote": "QuickCheck -->|\"Yes\"| SQ"
    },
    {
      "id": "E10",
      "source_id": "entry",
      "lines": [104, 109],
      "quote": "Grooming (Step 3.1) is autonomous research"
    },
    {
      "id": "E11",
      "source_id": "start",
      "lines": [7, 25],
      "quote": "Start([\"groom &lt;item_ref/&gt;\"]) --> Scope[\"Read scope.md\"]"
    },
    {
      "id": "E12",
      "source_id": "start",
      "lines": [45, 59],
      "quote": "Wait for all agents to complete before you continue."
    },
    {
      "id": "E13",
      "source_id": "start",
      "lines": [74, 89],
      "quote": "Every exit path \u2014 success, block, skip, drift, or error \u2014 ends at [finally.md](./finally.md)."
    },
    {
      "id": "E14",
      "source_id": "start",
      "lines": [99, 110],
      "quote": "groom items in parallel, capped at 5 concurrent items."
    },
    {
      "id": "E15",
      "source_id": "scope",
      "lines": [3, 21],
      "quote": "Grooming is a stand-alone pre-planning step."
    },
    {
      "id": "E16",
      "source_id": "scope",
      "lines": [23, 32],
      "quote": "a DEEP item (Detailed, Estimated, Emergent, Prioritized)"
    },
    {
      "id": "E17",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [5, 12],
      "quote": "First failure \u2192 SKIP."
    },
    {
      "id": "E18",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [14, 36],
      "quote": "If commits or merged PRs reference this item:"
    },
    {
      "id": "E19",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [38, 45],
      "quote": "Substitute found: update via `backlog_groom(selector='{item_ref}', section='Suggested Location', content='{substitute}')` \u2192 continue."
    },
    {
      "id": "E20",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [47, 59],
      "quote": "`metadata.added` older than 90 days AND `metadata.groomed` absent"
    },
    {
      "id": "E21",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [61, 78],
      "quote": "Evidence found: `backlog_resolve(selector='{item_ref}', summary='...')` \u2192 **SKIP**."
    },
    {
      "id": "E22",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [80, 85],
      "quote": "If `groomed == today's date` AND item has required groomed sections \u2192 **DRIFT**."
    },
    {
      "id": "E23",
      "source_id": "intake",
      "lines": [87, 116],
      "quote": "`research_first` | body, lines starting with `**Research first**:` or `Research first:`"
    },
    {
      "id": "E24",
      "source_id": "analyze",
      "lines": [6, 27],
      "quote": "Item labels include `type:fix` or `type:bug`"
    },
    {
      "id": "E25",
      "source_id": "analyze",
      "lines": [29, 54],
      "quote": "\u2192 **Synthesize** a feature-context artifact directly from those sections instead of invoking discovery:"
    },
    {
      "id": "E26",
      "source_id": "analyze",
      "lines": [56, 89],
      "quote": "`count == 0` \u2192 retry ONCE:"
    },
    {
      "id": "E27",
      "source_id": "analyze",
      "lines": [91, 131],
      "quote": "Nothing gates on the\nsnapshot."
    },
    {
      "id": "E28",
      "source_id": "analyze",
      "lines": [133, 149],
      "quote": "backlog groom --selector \"{item_ref}\" --section \"RT-ICA\" --content \"{snapshot}\""
    },
    {
      "id": "E29",
      "source_id": "swarm",
      "lines": [3, 5],
      "quote": "an agent that must react to another's output re-reads that section rather than waiting on a message."
    },
    {
      "id": "E30",
      "source_id": "swarm",
      "lines": [9, 38],
      "quote": "groomer** \u2014 Produce subsections: Reproducibility, Priority, Impact, Benefits, Expected\n   Behavior, Acceptance Criteria, Files, Resources, Dependencies, Effort."
    },
    {
      "id": "E31",
      "source_id": "swarm",
      "lines": [40, 46],
      "quote": "Each agent is a standalone `Agent()` call \u2014 no team, no `SendMessage` between\nagents."
    },
    {
      "id": "E32",
      "source_id": "swarm",
      "lines": [48, 65],
      "quote": "proceed to Wave 1 without research prior context \u2014 do not halt the groom."
    },
    {
      "id": "E33",
      "source_id": "swarm",
